e space (X,R), with|X|=n,|R|=m, CR constraintsT, and a parameter ε∈ (0,1), there exists a ran- domized algorithm that constructs a fair ε-net with respect to T, of expected size O(OPT·log(n))inO(poly(n,m))time, where OPT is the size of the smallest fair ε-net with respect to T."

